<title>USA: Marshalltown, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Marshalltown, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $4.885 m illion of Marshalltown, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a inte rest cost of 4.93 percent.</p>
